Reddwolf wrote:
> I just killed Medusa, but I don't have any way to break Perseus'
> statue. I have a =polymorph and =polymorph control so I was wondering
> if there are any monsters I can change into which can break a statue,
> or will I have to go searching for something else to break it?

Try to find a pickaxe or a mattock, a wand of striking, or a spellbook
of force bolt.
A spell of stone to flesh might conserve the contents of the statue, I'm
not sure about that, though.
The former tools can often be found in the equipment of a dwarf, and if
you happen to have a powerful pet you can find wands of striking in the
hands of shopkeepers.
In case you want to become some monster using polymorph, you may want to
try stealing that wand from a shopkeeper while in the form a nymph.

